# Intel BE200/BE211. iwlwifi's EHT receive path is broken there: access
# points drop to MCS 0, one stream, and Wi-Fi is unusable. Wi-Fi 6 (HE)
# works at full speed. Turn the plugin off once Intel fixes it.
options iwlwifi disable_11be=Y
